ARTOMETRICS GLOSSARY — PLACEHOLDER STUB
This is not a binary Adobe Illustrator file.
It is a text brief saved as .ai so an agent can find it next to the HTML starter.
Do not expect Illustrator to open it as vectors or layers.

Style: Impressionism
Board: /styles/impressionism
Companions: impressionism-starter.html, impressionism-study.ai, impressionism-study.psd

Artboards
1. Weather study, 3000 × 1800 px. An invented bank, water, and sky, built only from short separate strokes.
2. A pair, same size. Same invented motif, two different lights. Label them "earlier" and "later" in a plain sans. Not a series of a real place.

Palette
Sky #d5e2ea, #f4d7a1, #c5d4df. Field #7f9e7a, #c4b07a, #6e8f84. Water #6f92a8, #355872, #d7e4ee. One warm note #c9843a.

Rules
- Strokes stay separate. Do not merge them into a smooth gradient.
- No outline on a form.
- Not dots. A comma of color, not a point.
- Do not reproduce any existing painting.
